description:
Design a D latch with an asynchronous reset feature. When the RESET input is high, the output Q is immediately set to low regardless of the D input. When RESET is low, the output Q samples the value of D, storing it until the next reset.
module top_module(
    input wire D,
    input wire RESET,
    output reg Q
);

