Design a 4-to-1 multiplexer that selects one of four input signals (A, B, C, D) to output based on the values of two control signals (S1 and S0). When both control signals are low (00), it outputs A; with S0 high (01), it outputs B; with S1 low and S0 high (10), it outputs C; and with both control signals high (11), it outputs D.
module top_module(
    //# {{data|Data Signals}}
    input  A,
    input  B,
    input  C,
    input  D,
    output reg X,  // Change output to reg to allow assignment in always block

    //# {{control|Control Signals}}
    input  S0,
    input  S1
);

